= Instructions

Brew the @Espresso{} and let it cool completely.

Add the @Vanilla vodka{3 oz}, @Guinness{4 oz}, @Espresso{4 oz}, @Coffee liqueur{1 1/2 oz}, 
@Simple syrup{1 oz} 1:1, and @Ice{1 1/2 cups} to a blender.

Blend until smooth and creamy with a thick frozen consistency.

Pour into a chilled #Coupe or martini glass{}.

Garnish options:\
- @Coffee beans{3}\
- @Grated dark chocolate{}\
- A light dusting of @Cocoa powder{}